+#
+# This module implements Poly1305 hash for x86_64.
+#
+# March 2015
+#
+# Numbers are cycles per processed byte with poly1305_blocks alone,
+# measured with rdtsc at fixed clock frequency.
+#
+#		IALU/gcc-4.8(*)	AVX(**)		AVX2
+# P4		4.90/+120%      -
+# Core 2	2.39/+90%	-
+# Westmere	1.86/+120%	-
