+# Pentium	46	57	40/38		-	-
+# PIII		36	33	27/24		-	-
+# P4		41	38	28		-	17.3
+# AMD K8	27	25	19/15.5		-	14.9
+# Core2		26	23	18/15.6		14.3	13.8
+# Westmere	27	-	19/15.7		13.4	12.3
+# Sandy Bridge	25	-	15.9		12.4	11.6
